flow Note card [note: pop]

box stock as Check the stock [note: Counts whether the ordered item is still in the warehouse, example: One left means it can be sold]
box sell as Sell [note: Takes the payment and asks to ship]

step Check
  say A box with note gets an i mark at its top right. Click it and a card with the whole note and an example band opens just below.
  stock -> sell: in stock
